                        An Oasis of Uncompromised Splendor &amp; Tranquility
                    </h2>
                    <div class="luxe-divider-left"></div>
                    <p class="text-muted lead mb-4">
                        Nestled along pristine private coastlines, our estate offers refined architectural majesty harmonized with lush tropical flora.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-secondary mb-4" style="line-height: 1.8;">
                        Every suite is an enclave of discreet luxury, complete with dedicated personal butlers, bespoke dining privileges, and private ocean access. Whether unwinding in your private thermal plunge pool or embarking on a private yacht charter, your stay is elevated beyond the ordinary.
                    </p>
                    <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
                        <div class="col-sm-6">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center">
                                <i class="fa fa-check-circle fa-lg me-2" style="color: #C5A46D;"></i>
                                <span class="fw-bold" style="color: #172A28;">24/7 Personal Butler</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-6">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center">
                                <i class="fa fa-check-circle fa-lg me-2" style="color: #C5A46D;"></i>
                                <span class="fw-bold" style="color: #172A28;">Private Beach Access</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-6">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center">
                                <i class="fa fa-check-circle fa-lg me-2" style="color: #C5A46D;"></i>
                                <span class="fw-bold" style="color: #172A28;">Michelin-Starred Dining</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-sm-6">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center">
                                <i class="fa fa-check-circle fa-lg me-2" style="color: #C5A46D;"></i>
                                <span class="fw-bold" style="color: #172A28;">Holistic Spa &amp; Wellness</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <a href="/about-us" class="btn btn-luxe-gold">Read Our Heritage &amp; Story &amp;rarr;</a>
                </div>
            </div>
